flowchart TD
    HANDOFF{{tooling + spec handed off<br/>to GitHub Actions}}

    subgraph Actions["GitHub Actions"]
        CURATION[Curation Action<br/>runs nb-wrangler to generate<br/>code + data locks before build]
        REINSTALL[Reinstallation Action<br/>builds pre-locked image<br/>from unaltered spec]
        ADVISE[advisory tests on image<br/>imports & notebooks]
    end

    DOCKER[Docker build - pipeline]

    subgraph Registries["Registries & Environments"]
        GHCR[(GHCR container registry)]
        ECR[(Amazon ECR)]
        PROD[PROD]
    end

    JH[JupyterHub TEST spawner]
    TEST[Curator or pipeline<br/>tests image on platform]

    HANDOFF -->|tooling + spec| CURATION
    HANDOFF -->|tooling + spec| REINSTALL
    CURATION -->|locked spec| DOCKER
    REINSTALL -->|unaltered spec| DOCKER
    DOCKER -->|"Build Action pushes notebook/code + spec images"| GHCR
    DOCKER -->|"Build Action tests built image (advisory)"| ADVISE

    GHCR -->|spawner discovers & pulls| JH
    JH --> TEST
    TEST -->|tested image delivered| ECR
    ECR -->|promoted| PROD